This is the example file to tell you how to write input file.
All what you need to do is revising the variables to fit your system.
Energies as well as SPIN_ORBIT_COUPLING should be converted to atomic unit (hartree)
NAC should be converted to atomic unit
Temperature should be converted to unit 'K'
DAMPING_WIDTH should be converted to unit 'cm-1'
TIME_STEP should be converted to unit 'ps'


For FORMULA, if SUB==5, ISC rate constant -- Time-dependent, spin-vibronic coupling.
                               
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------                      
Values to set for ### Rate Constant Calculations ###:
      ENERGY_1 is the minima energy of initial state (S1 for ISC processes while T1 for RISC processes). 
      ENERGY_2 is the minima energy of final state (T1 for ISC processes while S1 for RISC processes). 
      LAMBDA_SUR and LAMBDA_SUR2 is the value of SURROUDING REORGANIZATION ENERGY, usually we set this value to 0, unless you know what you are doing. 
      ISC_SOC is the complex SPIN ORBIT COUPLING of inital state to final state. Use the format (real,imag).
      SOC_DERIV_FILE is the string, the filename of dSOC/dR OR dSOC/dQ, useful if (USE_HT=.TRUE. and SUB==5/14). in Cartesian coordinates or in normal modes.
      SOC_DERIV_MODE is a int, == 1 for dSOC/dR, (Cartesian coordinates). For USE_NASVC == .TRUE., SOC_DERIV_MODE must be set to 1.
                               USEFUL FOR (SUB == 5 AND USE_HT=.TRUE.)
      INIT_FILENAME is the .fchk file of inital state. 
      FINAL_FILENAME is the .fchk file of final state. 
      HESSIAN_FILE_1 is the initial hessian file name. 
      HESSIAN_FILE_2 is the final hessian file name. 
      NAC_FILE is the NAC file name.
      NAC_MODE is a int, == 1 for NAC is in Cartesian coordinates,
                         == 2 for NAC is in normal modes coordinates. (for SUB==12 or 13 or 15)
      CAL_REO is .TRUE. if you want to calculate reorganization energy.
                 .FALSE. if you already have the reorganization energy.
      CRYSTAL is .TRUE. if your QC calculation is done in a crystal enviroment.
                 .FALSE. if your QC calculation in vacuo or in PCM model.
      INTEGRAL_STEPS is the steps of integration.
      TIME_STEP is the time interval of the integration. (Unit: ps) 
      USE_DAMPING_FUNCTION is the LOGICAL parameter 
      DAMPING_WIDTH is a real number for Gaussian Damping Width with unit cm-1. 
      USE_DUSCHINSKY is a logical variable, determing use Duschinsky matrix or not (always set it to .TRUE. plz)
      USE_HT is a logical variable, determing include HT effects or not.
      USE_NASVC is a logical variable, determing include NA-SVC effects or not in SUB==5 or 14.
      SIMPLIFIED_SVC is a logical variable. TRUE means the simplified SVC formula in main2.tex;
                     FALSE means the full SVC formula in main.tex.
      NUM_STATES_SAME_SPIN_INIT is a int, determing the number of total states which has same spin with initial electronic state.
      TARGET_INIT is a int, determing which is the target state. (e.g. NUM_STATES_SAME_SPIN_INIT=3 and 
                                                                       TARGET_INIT=2 means 
                                                                       S2 is the initial state in S1 S2 S3)
      NUM_STATES_SAME_SPIN_FINAL is a int, determing the number of total states which has same spin with final electronic state.
      TARGET_FINAL is a int, determing which is the target state. (e.g. NUM_STATES_SAME_SPIN_FINAL=3 and 
                                                                        TARGET_FINAL=2 means
                                                                        T2 is the final state in T1 T2 T3)
      FN_NAC_SPIN_INIT is the file name of all NACs in a.u. between other same spin states with initial state.
                          (e.g. target S2, total S1/S2/S3, this file recording NAC of S2/S1, S2/S3)
      FN_NAC_SPIN_FINAL is the file name of all ANCs in a.u. between other same spin states with final state.
                          (e.g. target T2, total T1/T2/T3, this file recording NAC of T2/T1, T2/T3)
      FN_ENE_SPIN_INIT is the file name of all energies in a.u. between other same spin states with initial state.
                          (e.g. target S2, total S1/S2/S3, energies in order: S1 S2 S3)
      FN_ENE_SPIN_FINAL is the file name of all energies in a.u. between other same spin states with final state.
                          (e.g. target T2, total T1/T2/T3, energies in order: T1 T2 T3)
      FN_SOC_INIT_FINALS is the file name of all SOC in a.u. between other same spin states with initial state.
                           (e.g. target S2, total T1/T2/T3 for the other spin, this file recording SOC of S2-T1, S2-T2, S2-T3)
                           Each SOC should use the complex format (real,imag).
      FN_SOC_FINAL_INITS is the file name of all SOC in a.u. between other same spin states with final state.
                           (e.g. target T2, total S1/S2/S3 for the other spin, this file recording SOC of T2-S1, T2-S2, T2-S3)
                           Each SOC should use the complex format (real,imag).
      NUM_ZERO_HUANG_MODE is an int. It is the number/dimension of the array of ZERO_HUANG_FACTOR_MODES.  Plz don't change this key word. Not tested.
      ZERO_HUANG_FACTOR_MODES is an array. Set it to -1 if you don't want to set any huang_rhys factor to zero. Plz don't change this key word. Not tested.


====================================== VARIABLES FOR ALL CALCULATION ===================================
&FORMULA
SUB=5
/
========================================================================================================

================================= VARIABLES FOR RATE CONSTANT CALCULATION ==============================
&TEMPERATURE
TEMP=300.0
/

&INIT_ENERGY
ENERGY_1=0.000000000000E+00
/

&FINAL_ENERGY
ENERGY_2=1.359724E-3
/

&SURROUDING_LAMBDA
LAMBDA_SUR=0
LAMBDA_SUR2=0
/

&CAL_REO_ENE_OR_NOT
CAL_REO=.TRUE.
/

&SPIN_ORBIT_COUPLING
ISC_SOC=(-2.457233000000e-08, -2.768920000000e-08)
/

&NUMBER_OF_ATOMS
N_ATOMS=140
/

&CRY
CRYSTAL=.FALSE.
/

&INIT_FCHK_NAME
INIT_FILENAME="t1_freq.fchk"
/

&FINAL_FCHK_NAME
FINAL_FILENAME="s1_freq.fchk"
/

&HESSIAN_FILE
HESSIAN_FILE_1="t1_freq.hess"
HESSIAN_FILE_2="s1_freq.hess"
/

&NAC_FNAME
NAC_FILE="NAC_1.TXT"
NAC_MODE=1
/

&N_PROM_MODE ##### useless now #####
N_PROMOTING_MODE=1 ##### useless now #####
PROMOTING_MODE_FILE_NAME="promote_mode.txt" ##### useless now #####
/

&DAMPING
USE_DAMPING_FUNCTION=.TRUE.
DAMPING_WIDTH=10
/

&INTEGRAL_PARAMETERS
INTEGRAL_STEPS=50000
TIME_STEP=0.00001
/

&DUSCH
USE_DUSCHINSKY=.TRUE. 
/

&SVC
USE_HT=.TRUE.
USE_NASVC=.TRUE.
SIMPLIFIED_SVC=.FALSE.
/

&NASVC_PARAMS
NUM_STATES_SAME_SPIN_INIT=4
TARGET_INIT=1
NUM_STATES_SAME_SPIN_FINAL=1
TARGET_FINAL=1
FN_NAC_SPIN_INIT="NAC_1.TXT"
FN_NAC_SPIN_FINAL="NAC_2.TXT"
FN_ENE_SPIN_INIT="ENE_1.TXT"
FN_ENE_SPIN_FINAL="ENE_2.TXT"
FN_SOC_INIT_FINALS="SOC_1.TXT"
FN_SOC_FINAL_INITS="SOC_2.TXT"
FN_SOC_DERIV_INIT_FINALS="SOC_Deriv_1.TXT"
FN_SOC_DERIV_FINAL_INITS="SOC_Deriv_2.TXT"
NAC_MODE_FOR_NASVC=1
/

&HTSVC_PARAMS
FN_SOC_DERIV="SOC_Deriv.txt"
SOC_DERIV_MODE=1
/

&ZERO_MODE_HUANG_RHYS
NUM_ZERO_HUANG_MODE=0
ZERO_HUANG_FACTOR_MODES=1 2 3 4 5 
/

========================================================================================================

